  "_comment": [
    "Hand-authored while writing each base article (EVALS §2). Per (base_id,",
    "ticker): whether the company is genuinely present, its tier, and the",
    "placement facts the FR-8 formula needs. Variants inherit every field",
    "unchanged - the generator's operations are mechanical and constrained so",
    "that they cannot change presence, tier, title placement or mention count.",
    "tier is set only when present; ambiguous = the company is reachable in this",
    "article only through surfaces that need judgement; weak_only = no strong",
    "surface for it anywhere in the article; cue_free = no global corporate cue",
    "occurs in the article, so acceptance has to come from a per-company context",
    "term (at most 5 of these, EVALS §4).",
    "ordering_trap_group pairs a low-mention-count primary with a high-count",
    "context appearance of the same company: a mention-count ranker misorders",
    "every one of the twelve. Rows with present=false are the traps - they are",
    "the negative half of U_amb.",
    "This file is truth for M1, M1_amb*, M3 and (through derive_expected.py) M4."
  ],
